<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπ-αγορεύω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπερῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					14.11
				</span></i>
			: aor.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπεῖπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.171
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				60.15
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπείρηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			:—<i>give in</i> or <i>fail before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				15.59
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὑπὸ τραυμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Anach.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			; of inscriptions, <i>disappear first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				12.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>renounce beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν συμβίωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					15.7.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀρχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					1
				</span></i>
			.c.:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπειράμενοι τὴν φιλίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					4.5.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
